  "source": "literal",
  "description": "Stores the response as the api returns it. The sdk types PolicyDocument as a string holding a policy document as json text; the v2 runner parses a document held as text when a path reads into it, so the document itself is addressable. The Statement level is kept, and Action, Resource and the principal members stay as the document wrote them, which is a string or a list. The shape is spelled out here rather than patched onto the sdk shape, so what a plugin may read is visible in one place.",
